    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't even have anyone to talk to. my \"trusted friends\" or whatever were the first ones to disappear once things got messy. it's just me and this feeling that I've made a massive mistake by being a decent person. it feels less like a burden and more like a fundamental truth—that there's just no place for someone like me in this world. like the world has already decided i don't belong.",
